{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1103224868"}, "name":{"label":"Foogio"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-11T04:09:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11255292113"}, "title":{"label":"Add separate lists feature"}, "content":{"label":"It would be beneficial if you could create separate lists for separate categories. Other than that it’s perfect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id734608137"}, "name":{"label":"chuxfinn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-05-07T09:51:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11242409837"}, "title":{"label":"Life saver app"}, "content":{"label":"I am in my 60s and have ADHD.  This app is a true life saver. It allows me to be able to start and and sometimes even finish tasks that I would have forgotten easily, even using the built-in reminders app. The fact that it keeps alerting you and then allows for super easy and customizable rescheduling is pure genius. I recommend this to everyone but especially to those of us with slippery brains! Thanks again for making this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id502787652"}, "name":{"label":"SydShamblin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-25T09:03:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11199425865"}, "title":{"label":"Life Changing"}, "content":{"label":"Truly has made a huge difference in my life! With ADHD, it’s so hard to keep up with things, and this has absolutely changed things for me helping me to remind myself of things that I would otherwise forget. I’m really grateful for this app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id172177334"}, "name":{"label":"Dahow"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-24T05:56:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11195338998"}, "title":{"label":"Good but could be better"}, "content":{"label":"There is one limitation that I would like to see fixed. Sometimes I do a particular activity twice in the day and it would be nice to be able to set one reminder that goes off twice rather than having to set two reminders.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id31494592"}, "name":{"label":"mattwillms"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-17T17:57:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11171275868"}, "title":{"label":"Changed my life"}, "content":{"label":"This app has really changed how I organize my life.\n\nI use it as a brain dump to offload my thoughts. The thoughts I used to tell myself I would remember and never would. \n\nIt works so much better than the default reminders. I love the widget. I love the alerts. It’s top tier. \n\nIt’s a little scary how much I rely on an app, but I do.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id217499613"}, "name":{"label":"Pearls77"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-14T05:11:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11157311248"}, "title":{"label":"Great app with only one missing feature"}, "content":{"label":"Please consider adding location based reminders. That would be so helpful as we leave or arrive at locations. The app works great and syncs perfectly. So happy I switched from my other app I have been using for….forever! Just this one feature would really make it perfect!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id224593353"}, "name":{"label":"Agent Moeller"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-12T07:58:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11149870766"}, "title":{"label":"Recommendation"}, "content":{"label":"I highly recommend the following change to this app-\n\nWhen a user-created reminder becomes due and pops up on a locked iPhone screen, and the user swipes right on the reminder to open it, the user is taken to the editing screen for that reminder. \n\n99% of the time that I open the app this way, all I want to do is delete that reminder. So when a user swipes right to get to a reminder, it should just go to the list of reminders, and not the editing screen for that particular reminder.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id34831904"}, "name":{"label":"amart"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-11T21:03:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11148264982"}, "title":{"label":"It’s works."}, "content":{"label":"Somehow I am more productive with this app. No magic trick. It’s just a simple idea that works.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id408945243"}, "name":{"label":"d_jm13"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-09T01:56:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11138125123"}, "title":{"label":"SO GOOD"}, "content":{"label":"So many intuitive features and no bugs!! I love all the customizable snooze times, the simple layout. PLEASE PLEASE PLEASE can you add the ability to make reminders in a separate list with no alert, and the ability to have some scheduled for a specific day with no alert. I need this functionality in a todo app. Until then, I am stuck with the native reminders app", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id535266587"}, "name":{"label":"Weasley king"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-02T13:17:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11114477293"}, "title":{"label":"Extremely useful for ADHD peeps"}, "content":{"label":"It will snooze until you mark it as done. So even if it becomes a background, you can customize your snooze from the notification itself and surprise yourself with a different time. Helps me get to things even if it’s late but I get to it and it’s never forgotten! Thank you \n\nOne suggestion: Could you make timer available in the shortcuts app so I don’t have to go into the app to start or snooze. Plus show the timer running constantly in the Notification Center.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id34869724"}, "name":{"label":"mpmcconnell"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-19T03:42:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11061269504"}, "title":{"label":"Almost Great"}, "content":{"label":"This would be a great reminder app if not for one (basically critical) flaw: when you open the app, incomplete reminder notifications disappear from the lock screen. I asked customer service if there was a way to keep the notifications up after opening the app, and they said there wasn’t currently. This is pretty bizarre, but if they fix this, it will be my go-to app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1423252157"}, "name":{"label":"BelleC_97"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-14T02:06:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11042756781"}, "title":{"label":"Truly a beautiful app"}, "content":{"label":"I decided to get this app over 3 things, and I am so glad I did. The integration of Siri, and how quickly it is to set a new reminder can’t be beat. Definitely worth every bit of the asking price", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42300210"}, "name":{"label":"Foxie Lee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-09T08:14:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"11025921798"}, "title":{"label":"Update with Subscription"}, "content":{"label":"A really nice reminder app however with the new update it has now gone to $4.99 yearly for iPhone and iPad. The Mac has also gone to $9.99 a year so will delete from all my devices as I did like the app but a one time fee would have been better.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
