{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28140934"}, "name":{"label":"RosemaryT"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-01T15:34:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"10997688838"}, "title":{"label":"Do you have ADHD?"}, "content":{"label":"This is a great app that can gently pester you until you complete whatever task you set. You can set recurring tasks and different intervals. I have several licensure renewals that come at different times of the year that I would always lose track of. Due let’s me know about each one. It’s a huge relief!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id326125270"}, "name":{"label":"jajajoshua"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-03-01T13:34:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"10997401406"}, "title":{"label":"The best."}, "content":{"label":"I’ll make my review short and to the point: I don’t know how I could possibly go back to living without this app. It is everything a good app should be and more. I use it for major reminders (appointments, meetings) to the most mundane reminders (recurring trash take-out, clean out the fridge every 3 weeks). To see something pop up makes all the difference between tasks sitting on a static list and actually completing tasks.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id43021296"}, "name":{"label":"Takin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-24T16:08:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.2"}, "id":{"label":"10976284396"}, "title":{"label":"The most productive app on my phone"}, "content":{"label":"The auto snooze and incessant notification feature has done what almost no other reminder app could - it gets me to actually do the task. This was probably the smart app purchase I’ve ever made. \n\nIf I could change one thing, it’d be to add widget options with the controls on the left side for those of us who are left handed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
