{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id298798416"}, "name":{"label":"doctorslimwrist"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-06T19:33:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10910743766"}, "title":{"label":"intuitive to use, fast to set meaningful reminder times"}, "content":{"label":"I really like how the time selector intuitively works. Is there an API that I can connect to? I just want to be able to catch the number of tasks I complete each day to display on a different tool. I can’t seem to find anything online about one", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id14682313"}, "name":{"label":"piciescure"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-04T20:43:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10903284472"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing for people with ADHD"}, "content":{"label":"This app is a life game changer for me. Whatever reminder I set up, it notifies me over and over until I check “done.” I can snooze it or move it to another day. It’s way more helpful than a one time reminder. I use it for repeated daily things like plan my day, when I need to leave the house for an appointment, routine house chores like taking out the food waste every 2 days and don’t forget to eat lunch. I have ADHD and it helps me be on time for meetings or events and not forget important things. Just now, I got a reminder to take my medication. I went into the bathroom, got distracted, and forgot my med. Due reminded me again so I got back up and took it. I recommend this to many friends.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id20415512"}, "name":{"label":"Vermonty1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-30T04:39:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10880823601"}, "title":{"label":"Fantastic Reminder app"}, "content":{"label":"This is my favorite app, though I may have become too dependent on it because it’s so easy to use 😊!\nNot only is it a great app, it gets regular updates and additional features. It appears that the programmer really cares about creating a quality app. It’s the best five bucks I’ve spent in a very long time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id547575092"}, "name":{"label":"Big_@l"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-24T07:26:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10858953392"}, "title":{"label":"Cool App"}, "content":{"label":"I really like Due! One request:\n\n* Custom repeat times. There's a task that I want to repeat every 20 minutes, but the granularity only goes down to days", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35969697"}, "name":{"label":"vsupervia"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-19T07:23:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10839808317"}, "title":{"label":"still the best app of its kind!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had this app for many years. From time to time I look at other apps to see what I am missing. The answer is - nothing! I pay the yearly fee to the developer mostly to let them know folks are still out there using the app. New features have been added all along, like watch support. Try it: you’ll like the way it nags you to mark a task done, or to reset a timer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id87591670"}, "name":{"label":"JoToAg"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-16T02:19:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10827935814"}, "title":{"label":"Helps me get anything done"}, "content":{"label":"This app makes me a better husband, employee and father just to name a few areas where it has impacted my life. \n\nI use it as a task list, because other task lists I forget to check. The snooze reminders are great. As are the recurring 5 minute reminders. I can reliably ignore my watches alerting me, knowing that I will be notified in another five minutes. \n\nThanks for making me look dependable to those around me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
