{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id16814465"}, "name":{"label":"Asya1969"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-05T20:02:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"24.1"}, "id":{"label":"10789379288"}, "title":{"label":"My One and Only reminder app"}, "content":{"label":"Due is extremely customizable, and it not only reminds you of whatever task you set, but does an excellent job in making sure you don't mark it „done“ until it’s actually done. With a click, you can snooze it, or reschedule it. I have been using Due  for years now and happily pay for the yearly subscription pass - it’s dirt cheap for what you get and I want to support a developer who not only has the skills to think through and build in pretty much all aspects of what I would want from a reminder app, but keeps working on and improving it. Thanks so much!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
