{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id29306654"}, "name":{"label":"dot.mac"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-20T11:31:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10723823038"}, "title":{"label":"App has proved over the years you can trust it."}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Due since it came out years ago. On new Macs, old Macs, multiple iPhones. \n\nThe developer is constantly updating it to make it work correctly and sync across any kind of device you have.  It’s truly impressive, and one of the reasons I stick with it is that I know it’s not going to go away and vaporize all the work I’ve put into it. Highly recommended", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
