{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id32697301"}, "name":{"label":"Digitalsherpa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-05T17:55:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10661779769"}, "title":{"label":"Since Last Update"}, "content":{"label":"Since the last update everything has gone whacky. Alarms sound, then they all sound at once together later. On my Apple Watch my selections don’t show up on the iPhone. It’s a mess and I can’t rely on the alarms anymore.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id693154745"}, "name":{"label":"tb4apps"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-03T12:18:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10654154787"}, "title":{"label":"Great app"}, "content":{"label":"The app is awesome, the developer seems to really care and I hope the app will be around for a long time to come. I'm not a fan of subscriptions and appreciate the upgrade pass model, paying for upgrades you feel are worth while or passing if not, but being able to keep all previously paid for features permanently. My only concern is if I subscribe and then immediately unsubscribe kinda of a paid upgrade its good for a year, but I have seen complaints involving other apps where customers are having trouble unsubscribing and continued to be billed. I'd love to see a onetime lifetime payment option offered, and would seriously consider purchasing if offered. Anyhow keep up the great work, and if for any reason the app can't be maintained, I hope Apple would consider purchasing Due and keeping it around, it's that good. The app continues to improve and impress me. I have one request, in the timers section would it be possible to add days, months, and years and custom time picker like 360 days? It would work sort of like a timer reminder.  Really appreciate this app, great job.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35462894"}, "name":{"label":"MiguelAMunoz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-19T23:00:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10604556077"}, "title":{"label":"Love it!"}, "content":{"label":"It’s been my official reminder for years now. My only complaint is the syncing with the Apple Watch (as off Nov. 2023) it doesn’t take my snooze (neither 1, 3, +day) it keeps notifying the reminder until I respond on the iPhone.\n\nOther than that, it’s the best!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id31365895"}, "name":{"label":"Miss Collins 2001"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-19T06:07:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10602111844"}, "title":{"label":"Unorganized Person"}, "content":{"label":"I’m a forgettable person. This app helps me stay organized and reminds to do My To Do List.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39286001"}, "name":{"label":"DivergentJoleen"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-11T21:34:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10576652500"}, "title":{"label":"If you have ADHD, you want this!"}, "content":{"label":"Seriously, if you have any executive function issues, this app will help you change your life.  Things like repeating reminders if you don’t acknowledge the reminder (so if your phone beeps, you look at the reminder, and then intending to do it get distracted when finishing whatever you were in the middle of, it’ll beep again in just a little bit and remind you again). It’s also easy to say “I can’t do this for an hour” (or a day or whatever).\n\nSure, Apple has an app for reminders.  This is better and worth the money.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id283842572"}, "name":{"label":"Nealme10"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-10-19T19:15:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.9"}, "id":{"label":"10493980627"}, "title":{"label":"Neal"}, "content":{"label":"Love the app so far. Wish there was a notes section for each task. Some tasks require multiple iterations and notes would help write down last steps taken or phone numbers to call.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
